      "summary_sent_score": 0.14735658466815948
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "After the presentation of challan the offence u/s 376 IPC and Section 4 of Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act was added and he filed anticipatory bail application which was declined by the Court of Additional Sessions Judge, Sangrur vide order dated 02.12.2022 which is Annexure P-3.",
